<title>POLAND: DHL Polish sales seen up to $24 mln in '97.</title>
<headline>DHL Polish sales seen up to $24 mln in '97.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish unit of DHL Worldwide Express, DHL International (Poland) Ltd, expects 1997 sales revenues to rise to $24 million from $16.5 million in 1996, DHL's regional director said on Monday.</p>
<p>Peter Davies told a news conference that DHL wants to spend about $4 million per year on technology and work training.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
